  "view": "<div :class=\"getStyles()\" role=\"document\" x-data=\"Challenge\" x-init=\"id = 86; max_attempts = 100; attempts = 0\">\n  <div class=\"modal-content\">\n    <div class=\"modal-body py-4 px-4 px-sm-5\">\n\n      <div>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close float-end\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n\n        <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n          <li class=\"nav-item\">\n            <button class=\"nav-link active\" data-bs-target=\"#challenge\" @click=\"showChallenge()\">\n              Challenge\n            </button>\n          </li>\n\n          \n            \n            <li class=\"nav-item\">\n              <button class=\"nav-link challenge-submissions\" data-bs-target=\"#submissions\" @click=\"showSubmissions()\">\n                \n              </button>\n            </li>\n            \n          \n\n          \n            \n          \n\n          \n            \n          \n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"tab-content\">\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade show active\" id=\"challenge\">\n            <h2 class=\"challenge-name text-center pt-3\">\n              Ghost of Squares Past\n            </h2>\n            <h3 class=\"challenge-value text-center\">\n              150\n            </h3>\n\n\n            \n              <div class=\"challenge-tags text-center pt-2 pb-3\">\n                \n                  \n                    <span class=\"challenge-tag badge bg-info\">RP-01?</span>\n                  \n                    <span class=\"challenge-tag badge bg-info\">osint</span>\n                  \n                \n              </div>\n            \n\n            <small class=\"challenge-attribution text-center text-muted\">\n              <p>@RP-01?</p>\n\n            </small>\n\n            <span class=\"challenge-desc\"><iframe src=\"\" style=\"background-image: url('https://deadface.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/2026/img/wayfinder/ghost_of_squares_past.jpg');background-size:cover;background-position:center center;background-origin:content-box;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-color:rgba(40, 40, 40,0);min-height:80px;height:130px;width:100%;padding:10px;border:none\" title=\"Thumbnail\"></iframe>\n<sup>Created By: <code>@RP-01?</code></sup>\n<p>Intelligence gathered from DEADFACE communications suggests that the group has been using Savannah, Georgia's historic squares to conceal a coded message. Investigators recovered five clues, a combination of riddles and photographs, each pointing to a specific location within the city's historic district.</p>\n<p>DEADFACE appears to have arranged these locations into a compass pattern, with the first four representing North, East, South, and West, and the fifth marking the center.</p>\n<p>Your mission is to identify all five locations and reconstruct the hidden message before DEADFACE can put it to use.</p>\n<p>For the first four locations, determine the year each square was established. For the final location, identify the surname engraved on its monument.</p>\n<p>Flag Format: Deadface{YEAR-YEAR-YEAR-YEAR-SURNAME}</p>\n<p>Submit your findings in the order provided by the clues. The flag is the year each square was discovered and the name etched into the 5th point. All in order.</p>\n<h2>Point 1 - Riddle</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>First of them all, where the city began, A banker's green heart in Oglethorpe's plan. A Quaker from Rhode Island sleeps under stone here Mark the year this first square was laid out, and draw near.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Point 2 - Location</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://deadface.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/2026/challenges/osint/osint01/a21a3987-a4a5-4f3a-bdbc-c7e291e62459.png\">Point 2</a></p>\n<h2>Point 3 - Riddle</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Riddle Just a ways away a battle of a northern frontier Gave its name to this ground eighteen-twelve drawing near. Where a feather once drifted and a founder stands tall, Mark the year it was laid out, the newest of all.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Point 4 - Location</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://deadface.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/2026/challenges/osint/osint01/ffd355b4-85e9-439e-bc6a-ee04524d05ac.png\">Point 4</a></p>\n<h2>Point 5 - Riddle</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Four points now marked, good work, you did your best Their meeting point holds the key to this test. Carry their years in that order, and seek the lone name Carved in the stone where their center lays claim.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Submit the flag as: <code>deadface{YYYY-YYYY-YYYY-YYYY-surname}</code>. Example: <code>deadface{1990-1982-1956-1985-smith}</code>.</p>\n</span>\n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            <template x-if=\"max_attempts > 0\">\n              <p class=\"text-center\">\n                <span x-text=\"attempts\"></span>/<span x-text=\"max_attempts\"></span> tentatives\n              </p>\n            </template>\n\n            <div class=\"row submit-row\">\n              <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-8\">\n                \n                  <input\n                      id=\"challenge-id\" class=\"challenge-id\" type=\"hidden\"\n                      value=\"86\"\n                  >\n                  <input\n                      id=\"challenge-input\" class=\"challenge-input form-control\"\n                      type=\"text\" name=\"submission\"\n                      @keyup.enter=\"submitChallenge()\"\n                      placeholder=\"Flag\" x-model=\"submission\"\n                  >\n                \n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-4 mt-3 mt-sm-0 key-submit\">\n                \n                  <button\n                      id=\"challenge-submit\"\n                      class=\"challenge-submit btn btn-outline-secondary w-100 h-100\" type=\"submit\"\n                      @click.debounce.500ms=\"submitChallenge()\"\n                  >\n                    Soumettre\n                  </button>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"row notification-row\">\n              <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <template x-if=\"response\">\n                  \n                  <div class=\"alert text-center w-100 mt-3\"\n                      :class=\"{\n                        'alert-success': response.data.status == 'correct',\n                        'alert-info': response.data.status == 'already_solved',\n                        'alert-danger': response.data.status == 'incorrect',\n                        'alert-warning': response.data.status == 'paused',\n                      }\" role=\"alert\"\n                  >\n                    <strong x-text=\"response.data.message\"></strong>\n                    <div x-show=\"(response.data.status == 'correct' || response.data.status == 'already_solved')\">\n                      <div x-show=\"getNextId()\">\n                        <button @click=\"nextChallenge()\" class=\"btn btn-info mt-3\">\n                          Challenge suivant\n                        </button>\n                      </div>\n                      \n                      <div>\n                        <button x-show=\"!share_url\" @click=\"getShareUrl()\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-info mt-3\">\n                          Partager\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"btn-group mt-3\" role=\"group\" x-show=\"share_url\">\n                          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" @click=\"copyShareUrl()\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"Copied!\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-copy\"></i>\n                          </button>\n                          <a :href=\"'https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-twitter\"></i>\n                          </a>\n                          <a :href=\"'https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-facebook-f\"></i>\n                          </a>\n                          <a :href=\"'http://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?url=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-linkedin-in\"></i>\n                          </a>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                      \n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </template>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"submissions\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                <table class=\"table table-striped align-middle text-center\">\n                  <thead>\n                  <tr>\n                    <th>Submission</th>\n                    <th>Type</th>\n                    <th>Date</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  </thead>\n                  <tbody id=\"challenge-submission-names\">\n                  <template x-for=\"submission in submissions\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td x-data=\"{ truncate: true }\">\n                        <code x-text=\"truncate ? '*'.repeat(submission.provided.length) : submission.provided\"></code>\n                        <button class=\"btn btn-link p-0 pl-1\" @click=\"truncate = !truncate\">\n                          <i :class=\"truncate ? 'fas fa-eye' : 'fas fa-eye-slash'\"></i>\n                        </button>\n                      </td>\n                      <td x-text=\"submission.type\"></td>\n                      <td x-text=\"submission.date\"></td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </template>\n                  </tbody>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"solves\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                <table class=\"table table-striped align-middle text-center\">\n                  <thead>\n                  <tr>\n                    <th>Nom</th>\n                    <th>Date</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  </thead>\n                  <tbody id=\"challenge-solves-names\">\n                  <template x-for=\"solve in solves\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td>\n                        <a :href=\"solve.account_url\" x-text=\"solve.name\"></a>\n                      </td>\n                      <td x-text=\"solve.date\"></td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </template>\n                  </tbody>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"solution\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                <div class=\"challenge-solution-content pt-3\">\n                  <template x-if=\"solution\">\n                    <div x-html=\"solution\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">\n                    </div>\n                  </template>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
